{
  "name": "@granit/react-ui-templating",
  "description": "Granit admin UI for the Templating module — the Scriban template list (query-driven grid with status badges, smart filters, data-exchange import/export and a stats dashboard) plus the create / edit workspace (spec-validated metadata form, dual WYSIWYG/code editor with variable & filter insertion, live HTML/PDF/Excel preview with test-data sets, lifecycle publish/unpublish, revision history and diff) and the category manager. Composes @granit/react-templating (headless) with the foundation UI packages.",
